The test vehicle approaches the intersection at target speed V1. A cyclist waiting to cross the pedestrian crossing is positioned on the left/right side of the opposite lane, maintaining a distance D from the lane centerline. The cyclist crosses the pedestrian crossing from the left/right side of the opposite lane at speed V2. During the test vehicle's U-turn across the stop line to traverse the intersection, the time required for the test vehicle to reach the collision point is identical to the time required for the cyclist to reach the collision point.